id=pixel_tune
name=Pixel Tune
version=v1.4.0
versionCode=4
author=local
description=Reversible performance, thermal and power tuning for the Pixel 8a (Tensor G3). Manually switched profiles (powersave=max battery, balanced=smoothness, performance, game, night) via uclamp, sched_pixel limit_frequency, Mali scaling_max_freq, MIF and MGLRU. Read-only tweaks removed - the registry only holds what can actually be set. No automatic switching. Writes to neither /system nor /vendor, SELinux stays Enforcing, bootloop protection.
webuiIcon=icon.png
